/-! Propositional equality (PART 1 of the foundation).

Model unit `foundation_eq` — moved out of `crates/clean-verify/src/spec/core_spec/foundation_types.rs`
(embed memo W1). Registered by `Specification::register_model_unit(ModelUnit::FoundationEq)`
through the same `add_inductive` / `add_recursive_def` path the literals used; the
fidelity oracle in `spec/model_units/tests.rs` pins this file against the retained
literal. EVERY declaration must carry a `/-- ... -/` doc comment: its text is the
registered description, byte for byte. -/

/-- Propositional equality: Eq α a b means a and b are provably equal. -/
inductive Eq (α : Sort u) : α → α → Prop
| refl : forall (a : α), Eq α a a
